# junction-cue test scene (scratch, not shipped)
course EDGE "Edge demo"
music fairway
width  64
ball   rubber
# the back row: tall columns, 9 units
wall  rect   3 3 14 5  flat 9
# LEFT: a floor that touches the columns (5 units)
floor rect   3 5  8 9  flat 5
# RIGHT: one cell of void, then a floor 1 unit HIGHER that lands on the same line
floor rect   9 6 14 10 flat 6
# a pillar standing on the left floor (joined)
wall  rect   5 6  6 7  flat 8
# a pillar on the right with a moat of void round its front (a gap)
hole  rect  11 7 13 9
wall  rect  11 7 12 8  flat 8
start 4 6
